         a_tg="Ang written proof of loss (original policy o certificate, original receipts, invoices at iba pang docs) ay dapat ma-submit within 90 days after the loss. Tatanggapin pa rin kung talagang hindi kaya on time, pero hindi lalagpas ng 1 year mula sa date of loss (Proof of Loss, p. 42). Sa claim form, after 90 days pwedeng ituring na abandoned ang claim.",
